# hooks

## Назначение

React hooks: context consumers, browser API wrappers.

## Структура

```
{feature}/
├── index.ts
└── .partials/
    ├── hook.ts
    ├── hook.interface.ts
    └── …
```

Feature-имена — **плоские hyphenated** (`storage-local`, `storage-cookie`, `screen-size`).

## Naming

| Hook | Interface |
| ---- | --------- |
| `useToasts` | `UseToastsProps` |
| `useStorageLocal` | `UseStorageLocalProps` |

## Context hooks

```ts
export function useToasts(): UseToastsProps {
  const context = useContext(ToastsContext);
  if (!context) {
    throw new Error('useToasts must be used within <ToastsProvider>');
  }
  return context;
}
```

- Import context из `providers/`, не duplicate createContext
- Guard throw — обязателен

## Storage hooks

`hooks/storage-local/`, `hooks/storage-cookie/` — wrap services или direct browser API.

## index.ts

```ts
export const useToasts = BaseUseToasts;

export namespace useToasts {
  export type Props = UseToastsProps;
}
```

Re-export из `.partials/hook`; типы из `.partials/hook.interface.ts`.

## Правила

1. Hooks **не** содержат JSX (кроме rare render hooks — избегать)
2. **Не** axios/SWR в mosuk-ui hooks — это CRM app concern
3. Side effects — в provider; hook читает context/state
4. Feature-local hooks в `{feature}/.partials/hooks/` — для compound components (stepper)

## Эталоны

- `src/hooks/toasts/` — context consumer
- `src/hooks/storage-local/` — browser API
- `src/components/stepper/.partials/hooks/` — feature-local
